  "details": "1.) Open VRChat on an account that is part of many groups\n\n2.) Press ESC to open the Quick Menu Lanchpad\n\n3.) Select Groups\n\n4.) On the group list, find one that has a NEW notification\n\n5.) Check all the tabs for which one has the red dot - they should disappear as you check them.\n\n6.) Repeat this for all groups that have the NEW notification.\n\n7.) Eventually one of them may refuse to be cleared. This will be specific to the group and be persistent across things like re-logging or cache clears.",
